  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nHumans once wielded formidable magical power. But with over 7 billion of us on the planet now, Mana has spread far too thinly to have any effect. When hostile aliens reduce humanity to a mere fraction, the survivors discover an old power has begun to reawaken once again. \n\nAs the world begins to change, the survivors discover that the power of Mana is returning. Once the population reaches billions there is just no power of Mana left.. Now that the aliens have killed many the survivors can use the newfound power of Mana to save the human race. \n\nPowers are channeled and people come together to build fortresses and weapons. The survivors are able to use the power of Mana to fight back against the aliens and their minions. Once the aliens are defeated humans must decide if they want to repopulate and be less powerful or stay small in numbers to keep mana.",
